{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_047_1000_p", "source_sha256": "5d3d2e612a604bb4450d5dc9c5cdf213405ba7bdb55c6345ddaba3aa1defde3f", "ja": "（次は静香、ジュリア、恵美の3人で公演だ。\n今日は打ち合わせだけど、みんなもう来てるかな？）", "zh": "（下一场公演会由静香、茱莉亚和惠美三个人登台。\n今天要开会讨论，不知道大家都到了没？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_047_1001_p", "source_sha256": "7b204474cfba0e4f5f35a125267774a9432b55938e160ad511cfd3cb452f6dd3", "ja": "おーい、静香、恵美、ジュリア……あれ？\n千早と美希だけか？", "zh": "喂──静香、惠美、茱莉亚……咦？\n只有千早和美希在吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_047_1002_003mik", "source_sha256": "26867c6b213f935bbbdbef16c884b5d560a3853e8c5fecd554e966a966a524e9", "ja": "{$P$}、おはようなの♪\nうん、ミキたちだけだよ？", "zh": "{$P$}，早安唷♪\n嗯，现在只有美希我们在喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_047_1003_002chi", "source_sha256": "c81ac55aa7258f27c00a28950a3edf54c74be49925f73801ce197fdbb296c1c3", "ja": "お疲れさまです。どうかしましたか？", "zh": "辛苦了，请问有什么事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_047_1004_p", "source_sha256": "39cd1fbfd6e42423b5b2ddee36ab1ae44bad73d74b19a2b1ab076c0a6626a1f0", "ja": "次の公演のことで、静香とジュリア、恵美と\n待ち合わせてたんだ。どこかで見なかったか？", "zh": "我要跟静香、茱莉亚和惠美她们讨论\n下次公演的事，你们有看到她们吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_047_1005_003mik", "source_sha256": "4a34fb273c2996215c5bc747f8fb4e96a157be8264ce423739fd1ea3fbe1651d", "ja": "見てないの。\nどこかでお昼寝してるんじゃない？", "zh": "没有耶。\n她们或许在某处睡午觉吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_047_1006_p", "source_sha256": "0dda2830ab2ade42d199124e92a0027d36cbcc9aa4b6113887cf86cd616888fd", "ja": "いや、劇場に昼寝をしに来るのは\n美希だけのはずなんだが……。", "zh": "不，会来剧场睡午觉的\n只有美希你一个而已……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_047_1007_002chi", "source_sha256": "7992bc3a13895edc4fadb7f0741c9dbd18b2564ad3ec1e00681fb847e94f4ac2", "ja": "次の公演……そうでしたか。\n静香とジュリアと、所さんが……。", "zh": "下次公演……原来是这样啊。\n静香、茱莉亚和所她们要……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_047_1008_se", "source_sha256": "421e8235d80337cdfc8bd32cf5d5028931eb233154aec99a118f2ce3a412da5f", "ja": "ダダダダダ……！", "zh": "哒哒哒哒哒……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_047_1009_020meg", "source_sha256": "4583d287dcc6eaf991048ce9071218cf9779a0021d67ca8e0ca82a4198aa38e3", "ja": "ふー、ギリギリセ～フ！　あぶなかった～。　\nって、あれ？　もしかしてアウト？", "zh": "呼──勉强赶上～！好险～\n咦？还是已经来不及了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_047_1010_015siz", "source_sha256": "7071e3c4f3650c20dca40ed2d616dc7acebc0669365c9d121ff657b11c9c0902", "ja": "はあ、はあ……。だから時間つぶしに\nカラオケはやめましょうって、言ったのに……。", "zh": "呼、呼……\n所以我才说不要选卡拉OK打发时间嘛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_047_1011_050jul", "source_sha256": "dbe417c9ac77f12d72dc8f317ebc9bb572f2ad18b600d358d2832cb5b83be363", "ja": "おいおい、最後引っ張ったのはシズだろ？\nもう1曲、もう1曲ってさ～。", "zh": "喂喂，最后拖时间的明明就是静吧？\n一直吵着要再唱一首～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_047_1012_015siz", "source_sha256": "78d41204f0fab881ebc198ae7b258a3e9caf8aed4e654eab90066b0fecc2a717", "ja": "だ、だって！　ジュリアさんも恵美さんも\n95点以上出したのに、私だけ出せないままなんて……", "zh": "可、可是茱莉亚和惠美都拿到了95分以上，\n就我一个人没拿到……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_047_1013_020meg", "source_sha256": "3e09140727b086824d331a4613245c917e8da737ea83a4d6f64e5b9703beaa56", "ja": "だからアタシのは、たまたまだってば～。\nジュリアは3回も出したよね？", "zh": "就跟你说了，我只是运气好而已嘛～\n记得茱莉亚拿了三次对不对？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_047_1014_050jul", "source_sha256": "c608180d4904fd1d05b340b6f07c5f208119299d0fdde2c6a3c2fff92190faf8", "ja": "ん？　そんなにだっけ？\nははっ、悪い悪い！　ちょっと本気出しちまったかな♪", "zh": "嗯？有那么多吗？\n哈哈，抱歉抱歉！我好像稍微有点动真格了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_047_1015_015siz", "source_sha256": "97c94b8f7aa51ef053c3d24b61e6f165161e44a722263ee4a5186d0d72b27b5a", "ja": "～～～～～っ。", "zh": "～～～～～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_047_1016_p", "source_sha256": "96ffe83fda5317018dceb55cb352ffc4c0800233c5120d78f8c3151b66d095be", "ja": "と、とにかく、練習にはなったみたいだな。\nそれじゃ、公演の打ち合わせを始めようか。", "zh": "总、总之，那似乎不错的练习呢。\n那么，我们来讨论公演的事吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_047_1017_020meg", "source_sha256": "1e3f90caeaf4d69aae03df904df4586a41bcd79e1d490e162cab69626a86abe8", "ja": "あ、そうそう、お仕事お仕事っと♪\n……で、もしかして、千早と美希も出るの？", "zh": "啊，对对。该工作啦♪\n……啊，难道说千早和美希也会上场？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_047_1018_015siz", "source_sha256": "3c9a71a18438e2b27239ea2506c5d0e1ab8b16dfdf964dd08332e66b61a3a06b", "ja": "え？　……ええっ！？　{$P$}、\nどうして教えてくれなかったんですか！？", "zh": "咦……咦咦！？\n{$P$}，你怎么没跟我们说！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_047_1019_p", "source_sha256": "72b8bd1a64618da6edd2afcb6f5077807617eb24c2e73606fb00bf2ed114067e", "ja": "いや、二人はたまたま居合わせただけだよ。\nメンバーは予定通り、静香とジュリアと恵美の3人だ。", "zh": "不，她们两个只是刚好在场而已。\n成员跟预定的一样，是静香、茱莉亚、惠美你们三人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_047_1020_050jul", "source_sha256": "964227d529eb0744db649a03a58e52d1908302d70a41a6e7bf7c36a020714818", "ja": "なんだよ、期待したのに。\n……二人とも、別に飛び入りしていいんだぜ？", "zh": "什么嘛，害我期待了一下。\n……我倒是不介意你们两个中途加入喔？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_047_1021_003mik", "source_sha256": "b23fe730cfc8ff9fa7be95ce6796a9c26c182e823bf1b1ed885d1408781540d4", "ja": "あはっ。面白そうだけど、{$P$}に\n怒られちゃうから、やめとくね♪", "zh": "啊哈，好像很有趣，\n但{$P$}会生气的，还是算了吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_047_1022_002chi", "source_sha256": "ec7648c964bb22c1dbda6bf65850ba5e1756b655f34f77ee76a20891d3b5cfa6", "ja": "そうね。あまり想定外のことをするわけには。\nでも……。", "zh": "是啊，这样太唐突了。\n不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_047_1023_002chi", "source_sha256": "a6414d445292e6ece9f0cc8448a130b113d8f31078cd9454896987040680c4a5", "ja": "{$P$}。その公演、\n客席から見せてもらえませんか？", "zh": "{$P$}，\n可以让我在观众席上观赏这场公演吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_047_1024_015siz", "source_sha256": "cf60e61f489b37dd95f7f9751d8ac6a8e25672f18cae07033104270129e2354e", "ja": "えっ……？", "zh": "咦……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_047_1025_p", "source_sha256": "3c70bff71df85174abec1a1cedb72f451bca5c4949e4121c4610a41aa3a35b9b", "ja": "ん？　ああ、ちょうど関係者席に空きができたから、\n大丈夫かな。……でも、どうしたんだ？", "zh": "咦？嗯，正好有空出来的招待席，应该没问题。\n……不过，你为什么想在观众席上观赏？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_047_1026_002chi", "source_sha256": "be918275e37d52e020f542d1153101bed7837764030c88b8332f9d4f4c41d026", "ja": "……感じてみたいんです。\n客席で、3人のステージを。", "zh": "……我想感受看看。\n从观众席上感受这三个人的表演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_047_1027_020meg", "source_sha256": "f1462a85cabb2a5c6859198c0869565bfb36d09670dddd3a524b0e382375e65d", "ja": "え～～～！　もう、やめてよ千早～！\nそんな言い方されたら緊張するじゃん！", "zh": "咦～～～！讨厌，别这样啦千早～！\n你这么说会让人很紧张耶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_047_1028_002chi", "source_sha256": "862e53f6d2cdc067f7957874a58304bba1e7f088a6a3da9db95c0e7330f1bd4d", "ja": "あ……。そうね、ごめんなさい。\n3人のステージを、その……参考にしたくて。", "zh": "啊……也是呢，对不起。\n我只是，那个……想参考你们三人的表演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_047_1029_050jul", "source_sha256": "755e42825562a4de41418facff296a8fa227412f964135892d548916663f8f93", "ja": "ははっ、一緒のことじゃないか？　でも、となると、\nちょっと気合い入れ直さないとな。なあ、シズ？", "zh": "哈哈，意思还是没变嘛。不过这样一来，\n我们就得重新鼓起干劲了，对吧，静？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_047_1030_015siz", "source_sha256": "c933c462ddf66fbca5077e9a37df7e042f45fab118e8c02600f4a9546bc53522", "ja": "はい……！　千早さん、ありがとうございます。\n今度の公演、今の私の全部をぶつけますっ！", "zh": "没错……！千早，谢谢你。\n我会尽全力投入这次公演！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_047_1031_002chi", "source_sha256": "757dee1f055698f2b7a1e4bb0caf743d2275d7a85a5ed1293bb45c51d6ca4223", "ja": "静香……、いいえ、お礼を言うのは私のほう。\nありがとう、楽しみにしているわ。", "zh": "静香……不，该道谢的人是我才对。\n谢谢你，我很期待喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_047_1032_015siz", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_047_1033_003mik", "source_sha256": "fcd506e00678fd7ed68cb7ceb8fe21075ab4cf98a84cd75d39f5575ba78d7095", "ja": "あはっ、やっぱり面白そう！\nねえねえ{$P$}、ミキもミキも♪", "zh": "啊哈，好像很有趣！\n欸欸{$P$}，美希也要美希也要♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_047_1034_p", "source_sha256": "2ffd28078e899c4c0a74db3a5393900ab20b84701a0accf74f3045bfb50db349", "ja": "いいけど……\n近くのファンに騒がれないようにな？", "zh": "可以是可以……\n要注意别让附近的粉丝骚动起来喔？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_047_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_047_1035_003mik", "source_sha256": "d71ac305c4e9487027314263374bf5f4dc549f9ad0c2fe230e10af592cc72e4c", "ja": "はーい♪", "zh": "好～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
